    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gary Little at O'Brien Collins Little is delighted to offer to market this unique traditional cottage located on the exclusive Golf Links Road. Throw a stone and you'll hit miles of stunning beaches stretching from Laytown to Mornington. St Anne's is literally across the road to beach and access is via a boardwalk from golf links road. Just a short walk to village centre with all its amenities and the famous Bettystown/Laytown Golf Club and Tennis club are also within a very short walk. The property itself offers loads of character and is more or less unchanged from the original construction. Although well maintained, the property does require some upgrade and modernization. Accommodation briefly includes; lounge room, kitchen, sitting room, 3 bedrooms and bathroom. To rear is a lovely private south west facing garden which offers ample room to extend house if desired. A unique opportunity for either homeowner or as holiday home on one of the most sought after roads in north east. Viewing strictly by appointment.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: 2.16 x 0.91\r\nLaminate wood floor\r\nLounge room: 2.74 x 4.35\r\nLaminate wood floor\r\nKitchen: 2.43 x 2.32\r\nFitted units, laminate wood floor, back door\r\nBathroom: 2.22 x 1.77\r\nElectric shower, wc, whb, painted wood panel walls\r\nSitting room: 4.8 x 3.5\r\nLaminate wood floor, hot press, windows to rear garden\r\nBedroom 1: 3.04 x 1.44\r\nOriginal cast iron fireplace, laminate wood floor\r\nBedroom 2: 2.7 x 2.11\r\nLaminate wood floor\r\nBedroom 3: 2.14 x 2.77\r\nLaminate wood floor\r\n\r\nFeatures: \r\n1. Across the road from boardwalk to beach\r\n2. 1 Minute to Bettystown Village\r\n3. 2 Minutes to Bettystown Golf Club\r\n4. Walled front garden\r\n5. Sunny rear garden (not overlooked)\r\n6. Mix of Upvc double glazed and wood windows\r\n7. Oil Heating"
      },
      {
